{"Metrics call uses 'name' as the label argument instead of the resource kind (options.Kind), emitting high-cardinality metric series per object name and misaligning with the rest of the dashboard.": 0.9457216858863831, "The goroutine that replicates the write to the legacy store inherits the original request context which gets cancelled when the REST handler returns, causing context.WithTimeoutCause to observe an already cancelled parent and return immediately - the asynchronous legacy Create/Delete/Update/DeleteCollection operations never actually execute, silently degrading Mode 3 to write only to unified storage. Need to detach the context before spawning the goroutine using context.WithoutCancel(ctx) or context.Background() plus required values.": 0.9602570533752441, "DeleteCollection records the legacy operation time via recordStorageDuration instead of recordLegacyDuration, misclassifying errors and latency metrics as storage operations instead of legacy operations.": 0.9932685494422913}